Subtask 1.2: Understand the Concept
Content Views are filtered sets of content that define what packages, errata, and puppet modules are available to systems. They act as snapshots of content at specific points in time.

Lifecycle Environments represent different stages in your content promotion workflow (Development → Testing → Production).

