Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Content View Promotion Fails
Problem: Promotion task fails with dependency errors

Solution:

# Check task details
hammer task list --search "label = Actions::Katello::ContentView::Promote"

# Verify repository synchronization
hammer repository list --organization "Default Organization"

# Re-synchronize if needed
hammer repository synchronize --name "repository-name" --organization "Default Organization"
Issue 2: Content Not Available in Environment
Problem: Content view shows as promoted but packages not available

Solution:

Verify content view version in environment
Check activation key associations
Regenerate repository metadata:
hammer content-view version republish-repositories \
  --content-view "RHEL8-BaseOS-CV" \
  --version "1.0" \
  --organization "Default Organization"
Issue 3: Composite Content View Issues
Problem: Composite content view fails to publish

Solution:

Ensure all component content views are published
Check for conflicting content
Verify component content view versions are promoted to required environments
Verification and Testing
Verify Content View Configuration
Check Content View Status:

# Verify all content views
hammer content-view list --organization "Default Organization"

# Check specific content view details
hammer content-view info --name "RHEL8-BaseOS-CV" --organization "Default Organization"
Verify Environment Promotion:

# Check content view versions in environments
hammer content-view version list \
  --content-view "RHEL8-BaseOS-CV" \
  --organization "Default Organization"
